@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 70
title State machine: Session
[*] --> Planned : from the group's calendar events
[*] --> Saved : recorded after the fact
Planned --> Cancelled : date cancelled,\nliber or pause
Planned --> NotDone : date passed,\nno attendance
Planned --> Saved : coach or admin saves
NotDone --> Saved : coach or admin saves
Saved --> Saved : correction\n(coach until end of month,\nadmin any time)\n/ history entry
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
